description: Apply feature and behavior changes across the application unless explicitly scoped to Test Account
alwaysApply: true
---

# Feature request scope

- Treat feature and behavior requests as app-wide unless the user explicitly limits the request to Test Account or another account.
- A demonstration login, screenshot, or Test Account example does not restrict the feature implementation to that login or account.
- Keep explicitly requested Test Account data changes confined to Test Account; sample data does not change the scope of shared application behavior.
